{"id":"708dbbb6cfe69b79","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-work-space-hierarchy.md","title":"Deterministic Space Hierarchy","display":"thm-deterministic-space-hierarchy — Deterministic Space Hierarchy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-work-space-hierarchy","aliases":["73-thm-work-space-hierarchy","73-thm-deterministic-space-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-deterministic-space-hierarchy — Deterministic Space Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","[[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-work-space-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-work-space-hierarchy</span><span>73-thm-deterministic-space-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-deterministic-space-hierarchy — Deterministic Space Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cadee7248274622b\" href=\"?note=cadee7248274622b\" title=\"73-df-exact-work-space-construction\">73-df-exact-work-space-construction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{DSPACE}\\)</span> (deterministic work-space classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}\">\\(\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}\\)</span> (full space constructibility, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cadee7248274622b\" href=\"?note=cadee7248274622b\" title=\"73-df-exact-work-space-construction\">73-df-exact-work-space-construction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall s_1,s_2:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s_2)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\leq s_1(n)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;\\bigl(b\\,s_1(n)\\leq a\\,s_2(n)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s_1)\\subsetneq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s_2)\n\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall s_1,s_2:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s_2)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\leq s_1(n)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;\\bigl(b\\,s_1(n)\\leq a\\,s_2(n)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s_1)\\subsetneq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s_2)\n\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantified <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> clause is the explicit meaning of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_1=o(s_2)\">\\(s_1=o(s_2)\\)</span>; the logarithmic lower bound makes configuration addressing available in the adopted multitape model.</li>\n<li>A clocked diagonal machine stays within <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s_2)\">\\(O(s_2)\\)</span> work cells and disagrees with every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(s_1)\">\\(O(s_1)\\)</span> decider on its own description, supplying the strict witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-exact-work-space-construction","status":"resolved","id":"cadee7248274622b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DSPACE}$ (deterministic work-space classes, see [[73-df-deterministic-work-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-exact-work-space-construction","status":"resolved","id":"cadee7248274622b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}$ (full space constructibility, see [[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{DSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}space\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall s_1,s_2:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s_1)\n\\land\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s_2)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\leq s_1(n)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;\\bigl(b\\,s_1(n)\\leq a\\,s_2(n)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s_1)\\subsetneq\\mathsf{DSPACE}(s_2)\n\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"s_1=o(s_2)","display":false},{"tex":"O(s_2)","display":false},{"tex":"O(s_1)","display":false}],"bytes":1551,"backlinks":[{"id":"d3b87736727e237a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1a769cdc24b3e236","cadee7248274622b"]}